167
00:10:19,480 --> 00:10:20,490
Brother Wang !

168
00:10:21,200 --> 00:10:22,290
What's the matter ?

169
00:10:22,960 --> 00:10:25,490
Master Sun led us all the way

170
00:10:25,640 --> 00:10:27,050
to the entrance.

171
00:10:27,280 --> 00:10:29,890
But we met a shaman that used a strange technique

172
00:10:30,640 --> 00:10:32,730
