185
00:11:25,240 --> 00:11:26,370
Brother Wang...

186
00:11:26,480 --> 00:11:27,850
Brother Wang...

187
00:11:28,000 --> 00:11:30,690
Help me !

188
00:11:39,000 --> 00:11:40,730
Senior, don't act hastily.

189
00:11:49,080 --> 00:11:49,930
Master !

190
00:11:55,480 --> 00:11:58,010
