198
00:12:24,840 --> 00:12:26,010
No problem.

199
00:12:25,800 --> 00:12:27,530
This is a very dangerous place.

200
00:12:27,960 --> 00:12:29,270
Still no signs

201
00:12:29,040 --> 00:12:30,450
